      "name": "Staff — Light rail destination",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "staff-navigation-active",
      "description": "Role-aware staff destinations use the shared reference-style outline icon set, light gray rail, and gray active selection.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-client-rail\" aria-label=\"Кабинет клиента\"><a class=\"ds-client-destination\" href=\"/account\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8Z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8\"/></svg>Мое дело</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-client-rail{padding:1rem;background:#f3f4f6;}.ds-client-destination{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.625rem;min-height:44px;padding:.625rem .875rem;border-radius:.5rem;color:#1f2937;text-decoration:none;font:500 .875rem/1.25rem Garet,sans-serif;}.ds-client-destination[aria-current=page]{background:#e5e7eb;color:#030712;}.ds-client-destination:hover{background:#e5e7ebb3;color:#030712;}.ds-client-destination:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #2563eb;outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Staff — Expandable directory record",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "staff-directory-row",
      "description": "Reference-styled staff directory retains inline disclosure, role permissions, search, and pagination.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-directory\"><details class=\"ds-record\"><summary class=\"ds-record-summary\"><span class=\"ds-person\"><span class=\"ds-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">И</span><span class=\"ds-person-copy\"><strong class=\"ds-person-name\">Имя сотрудника</strong><small class=\"ds-person-email\">name@example.com</small></span></span><span class=\"ds-role\">Юрист</span><span class=\"ds-access\">Активен</span><svg class=\"ds-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"m9 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"ds-record-detail\"><a class=\"ds-record-action\" href=\"/staff/cases\">Назначенные дела</a><a class=\"ds-record-action\" href=\"/staff/audit\">История действий</a></div></details></div>",
      "css": ".ds-directory{border:1px solid var(--line,#e5e7eb);border-radius:var(--radius,12px);background:var(--surface,#ffffff);color:var(--ink,#030712);overflow:hidden;font-family:Garet,sans-serif;}.ds-record-summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(240px,1.6fr) minmax(150px,1fr) 100px 18px;align-items:center;gap:20px;min-height:86px;padding:1rem;list-style:none;font-weight:400;cursor:pointer;}.ds-record-summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}.ds-record-summary:hover,.ds-record[open]>.ds-record-summary{background:var(--canvas,#f3f4f6);}.ds-record[open] .ds-chevron{transform:rotate(90deg);}.ds-person{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;min-width:0;}.ds-person-copy{min-width:0;}.ds-person-name{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-person-email{display:block;margin-top:4px;color:var(--muted,#6b7280);font-size:13px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-avatar{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;flex:none;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--surface-soft,#e0e2f2);color:#414788;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;}.ds-role{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#6b7280);}.ds-access{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;color:var(--accent,#414788);font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;}.ds-access::before{content:\"\";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent,#414788);}.ds-record-detail{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 24px;padding:12px 24px 24px 73px;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#e5e7eb);}.ds-record-action{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;color:var(--accent-ink,#414788);font-size:14px;text-underline-offset:.2em;}.ds-record-action:hover{color:var(--accent-hover,#373c6d);}.ds-record-summary:focus-visible,.ds-record-action:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#414788);outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-record-summary{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 18px;padding:17px 16px;gap:8px;}.ds-person{grid-column:1;grid-row:1;}.ds-role,.ds-access{grid-column:1;padding-left:51px;font-size:12px;}.ds-chevron{grid-column:2;grid-row:1/4;}.ds-person-email{font-size:12px;}.ds-record-detail{padding:12px 16px 20px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Authentication - Outline submit",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "auth-submit",
      "description": "Purple outlined action preserving pending and disabled form states.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-auth-submit\">Войти</button>",
      "css": ".ds-auth-submit{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;min-height:48px;margin-top:4px;padding:10px 16px;border:1.5px solid #a3a9d7;border-radius:8px;color:#4c53a0;background:white;font:400 16px/1.5 Garet,sans-serif;box-shadow:none;}.ds-auth-submit:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:#4c53a0;background:#eff0f9;}.ds-auth-submit:disabled{opacity:.65;}.ds-auth-submit:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #4c53a0;outline-offset:3px;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The casework portal",
    "overview": "The user retains the visual language of `https://sovz-lk.ru` for the authorized Kazakhstan subsidiary: Garet typography, light gray rails, white rounded panels, purple accents, dark buttons, original logo, and icon geometry. The corrected brief separates that styling from product scope. Client `/account` and staff `/staff` are distinct role-guarded workspaces; cabinet mode switches, advertising, and promotional photo rails are excluded.\n\nThe reference world covers `.sovz` client pages and every `/staff` route. `app/reference-design.css` supplies shared primitives; `components/StaffReferenceShell.tsx` and `app/staff-reference.css` adapt role-aware staff navigation, forms, directories, and conversations to that same world. `app/staff/layout.tsx` selects the reference shell, retaining `lawyer-shell` where required. `AuthFrame`, `AuthForm`, and the last-imported `app/auth-reference.css` extend the reference language to Kazakhstan authentication. **Keys prefixed `client-` are shared reference tokens despite their historical name; `staff-` component keys record staff-specific variants. `auth-` keys describe the current entry surfaces. Unprefixed tokens retain the legacy base layer, not current staff or reference authentication appearance.** White `surface` is shared. CSS remains the implementation source, including component exceptions.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Separate client and staff navigation, with a full-width working area beside the light rail.",
      "Real Supabase cases, tasks, documents, conversations, contracts, manual payments, and receipts in ₸.",
      "Optional client MFA setup with a dismissible prompt; server-controlled staff security remains intact.",
      "Role-aware staff search, bounded lists, and conversation behavior within the reference shell."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Borderless Entry Card Rule",
        "body": "Authentication cards use soft shadow; gray borders belong to fields and purple outlines to submit actions.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do retain Garet Book, light rails, white panels, purple accents, charcoal actions, and original logo/icon geometry.",
      "Do keep client `/account` and staff `/staff` separate under their existing role guards.",
      "Do preserve staff permissions, search, pagination, and chat behavior within the light reference shell.",
      "Do use real account data, ₸ amounts, permission checks, and honest errors or empty states.",
      "Do retain visible focus, readable control values, and actual security/legal state."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't add cabinet mode switches, advertising, or promotional photo rails anywhere.",
      "Don't turn reference-only features into product requirements; use `Sovremennaya_Zashchita_AI_Agent_Spec.md` for scope.",
      "Don't restore the old slate/green staff shell or legacy authentication composition.",
      "Don't invent balances, cases, receipts, or published legal documents to match screenshots.",
      "Don't call source review, successful builds, or HTTP checks rendered or pixel-perfect acceptance.",
      "Don't treat this pass as native release, load-test, or physical-device acceptance."
    ]
  }
